See `packages/db/AGENTS.md`. Every schema change ships with `pnpm db:generate --name <descriptive_name>`. Never edit an applied migration. `timestamptz` everywhere, explicit `onDelete`, index foreign keys, secrets encrypted, tokens hashed.
